                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This report has been created so that you can see the current demographics across the business. On this Home Page you can select the filters you want the ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Demographics",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#7355a3"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "report to be based on.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On the right select the ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Business Unit",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " you want to filter down on. On this page and any other, you can still filter using the slicers for Tenure, Job Title, Ethnicity Group, FTE, Employment Status, Location and Work Type. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On most relevant data points such as bars in various charts you can right click and 'drill through' to go to the details page which will show the Kaimahi that make up the numbers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "From there you have options such as exporting the data to csv/excel format, which you can learn more about from the help page.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
